        <object placeholders="1" c4Name="3. Ja processei esta mensagem?" c4Type="Component" c4Technology="MongoDB Driver / collection processed_events" c4Description="O Pub/Sub pode entregar a MESMA mensagem duas vezes. O handler tenta registrar o &lt;i&gt;EventId&lt;/i&gt; protegido por indice unico.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Ja existe? ignora e confirma. Sem isso, o saldo dobraria.&lt;/i&gt;" label="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;%c4Name%&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px&quot;&gt;[%c4Type%: %c4Technology%]&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px&quot;&gt;%c4Description%&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" id="a3">
